title: TelephoneBooth
---
<<declare $telephone_booth_interaction_times = 0>>
<<if $telephone_booth_interaction_times==0>>
 A traditional telephone booth.
 You recall how it hasn't worked in years.
 You repress the urge to try anyways.
 <<set $telephone_booth_interaction_times = 1>>
<<elseif $telephone_booth_interaction_times==1>>
 Call someone in the phone booth?
 bzzt!! 
 The phone gives you nothing but static.
 <<set $telephone_booth_interaction_times = 2>>
<<else>>
 A phone booth!
<<endif>>
===
